{"t":"259960.KS","n":"KRAFTON, Inc.","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":196900.0,"chg":6000.0,"chgPct":0.03143,"prev":190900.0,"dayH":198500.0,"dayL":190800.0,"w52H":303500.0,"w52L":178500.0,"vol":84213,"avgVol":117829,"mcap":8592609509376,"pe":null,"fpe":8.79,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":2240.0,"divY":0.0117,"beta":0.74,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Communication Services","sKo":"통신 서비스","i":"Electronic Gaming & Multimedia","iKo":"전자 게임 및 멀티미디어","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.krafton.com","sum":"KRAFTON, Inc. engages in the software development and related ancillary businesses in Asia, Korea, the United States, Europe, and internationally. The company offers PC, mobile, console, and other games. It is also involved in development and distribution of mobile games and applications, and game software business; consulting advisory and investment activities; production of video contents; and development and servicing of games. The company was formerly known as Bluehole Studio Inc. and changed its name to KRAFTON, Inc. in November 2018. KRAFTON, Inc. was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","sumKo":"KRAFTON, Inc.는 아시아, 한국, 미국, 유럽 및 국제적으로 소프트웨어 개발 및 관련 부대 사업에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 PC, 모바일, 콘솔 및 기타 게임을 제공합니다. 또한 모바일 게임 및 애플리케이션의 개발 및 배포, 게임 소프트웨어 사업에도 참여하고 있습니다. 컨설팅 자문 및 투자 활동; 영상콘텐츠 제작; 게임 개발 및 서비스. 이 회사는 이전에 Bluehole Studio Inc.로 알려졌으며 2018년 11월에 KRAFTON, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. KRAFTON, Inc.는 2007년에 법인화되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":1854016090000,"ni":500154030000},{"y":2023,"rev":1910576180000,"ni":594060310000},{"y":2024,"rev":2709800000000,"ni":1302600000000},{"y":2025,"rev":3326600000000,"ni":734800000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":919700000000,"ni":-20000000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":1371415010000,"ni":514790570000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":1290200000000,"ni":-27400000000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":971400000000,"ni":-64100000000}],"eps":[{"q":"3